              Your browser does not support embedded video. <a href="/video/ai-ugc-video-lab/tactical-raccoon-1.mp4">Download the MP4</a>.
            </video>
            <figcaption><span class="ad-id">TH-01</span>“So yeah, my perimeter security is a raccoon.” Pan to the raccoon by the door, then back to Dev for “Nobody has come in.”<span class="ad-len">11.8s</span></figcaption>
          </figure>
        </li>
        <li>
